    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "跨大版本升级 Aurora 时保住 Debezium 连接器",
      "summary": "Arko Dutta 给出一种在 Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL 跨大版本升级时让 Debezium 连接器继续跑的做法，避免全量重新快照。思路是用原生逻辑复制在源集群和目标集群之间搭一座同步桥。切换时先停掉订阅，手工同步序列值，在目标集群上建新的复制槽，再把连接器指向目标集群并设 snapshot.mode=never。因为保持同一个 topic 前缀，消费者只会看到短暂中断，文中测试切换耗时约 2 秒。",
      "url": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/database/migrate-amazon-aurora-postgresql-across-major-versions-with-active-debezium-cdc-connectors-using-native-logical-replication/",
      "author": "Arko Dutta",
      "source": "AWS 数据库博客",
      "source_date": "2026-08-12",
      "image": "https://d2908q01vomqb2.cloudfront.net/887309d048beef83ad3eabf2a79a64a389ab1c9f/2026/08/07/DBBLOG-5694-featured-image.png",
